<title>MEXICO: Two Mexico crude ports closed by weather - officials.</title>
<headline>Two Mexico crude ports closed by weather - officials.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's crude export ports of Pajaritos and Dos Bocas were closed Sunday due to bad weather, a port official and the Communications and Transport Ministry said.</p>
<p>&quot;Pajaritos has been closed since 1515 Saturday (2115 GMT) and the situation will be reviewed at 1800 Sunday (midnight GMT),&quot; an official at Pajaritos said by telephone.</p>
<p>The Communications and Transport Ministry said in a ports report earlier that Dos Bocas was also closed while the third crude export port of Cayo Arcas was open.</p>
<p>((-- Martin Langfield, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7902))</p>
